Comment: BioKids is MIT throughout, and deliberately so: a dependency whose
 licence would force this project to change its own is not accepted, which
 keeps the packaging free of per-file exceptions. Programs BioKids only
 invokes as separate processes - dnsmasq, Chromium, Piper - carry their own
 licences and are dependencies, not part of this source package.

